        {
          "type": "text",
          "number": 5,
          "title": "CALCULATION",
          "new_page": false,
          "text": [
            "Without RC (Pre-Layout)",
            "$NM_H = V_{OH} - V_{IH} = 1.8 - 0.8274818 = 0.9725182\\,V$",
            "$NM_L = V_{IL} - V_{OL} = 0.5414587 - 0 = 0.5414587\\,V$",
            "$t_{PHL} = t_{HL,out} - t_{HL,in} = 20.09002 - 20.075 = 0.01502\\,ns$",
            "$t_{PLH} = t_{LH,out} - t_{LH,in} = 10.1587 - 10.125 = 0.03370\\,ns$",
            "$t_{pd} = \\frac{t_{PHL}+t_{PLH}}{2} = \\frac{0.01502+0.03370}{2} = 0.02436\\,ns$",
            "$t_r = t_{r90} - t_{r10} = 10.18934 - 10.14045 = 0.04889\\,ns$",
            "$t_f = t_{f10} - t_{f90} = 20.09996 - 20.07914 = 0.02082\\,ns$",
            "With RC (Post-Layout)",
            "$NM_H = V_{OH} - V_{IH} = 1.8 - 0.827543 = 0.972457\\,V$",
            "$NM_L = V_{IL} - V_{OL} = 0.5414642 - 0 = 0.5414642\\,V$",
            "$t_{PHL} = t_{HL,out} - t_{HL,in} = 20.09705 - 20.075 = 0.02205\\,ns$",
