          "type": "text",
          "number": 7,
          "title": "RESULT",
          "new_page": false,
          "text": "The static CMOS inverter was successfully designed and simulated in 180 nm technology. After RC extraction, propagation delay, rise time, and fall time increased due to layout parasitics, while the noise margins showed only minor variation."
